00:01:56.849 --> 00:01:58.017
I never get to see it.

00:01:58.017 --> 00:01:59.585
-No, you can't see it.
-That's the only --

00:01:59.585 --> 00:02:01.687
That's the problem.
-[ Laughing ] Yeah.

00:02:01.687 --> 00:02:03.255
-That's why I can't sleep
at night.

00:02:03.255 --> 00:02:05.425
I can't see most of my tattoos.

00:02:05.425 --> 00:02:08.094
-You should get a mirror
that's a double mirror

00:02:08.094 --> 00:02:10.196
so you can see yourself
in the mirror backwards

00:02:10.196 --> 00:02:11.463
so you can read your tattoos.

00:02:11.463 --> 00:02:12.665
You know what I'm saying?

00:02:12.665 --> 00:02:13.733
-Yeah, I think.

00:02:13.733 --> 00:02:15.167
But I'm a vampire,
so I can't even --

00:02:15.167 --> 00:02:16.302
I don't have a reflection.
-Oh, I forgot.

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:17.603
I forgot.
-I don't have a reflection.

00:02:17.603 --> 00:02:19.405
You don't understand what --
-You're Count Dracula Jr.

00:02:19.405 --> 00:02:24.276
-[ As Sara ] You don't even
understand what my life is like.

00:02:24.276 --> 00:02:26.713
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:26.713 --> 00:02:30.516
You don't understand
what my life is like!

00:02:30.516 --> 00:02:32.552
Vampire with tattoos.

00:02:33.653 --> 00:02:36.355
[ Normal voice ] All right.
This is from @mahuls.

00:02:36.355 --> 00:02:38.190
