-Oh!

00:02:44.564 --> 00:02:45.999
That's that.

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:50.336
Uh, I'm missing, uh,
singles 7 through 10.

00:02:50.336 --> 00:02:52.538
[ Laughter ]
-Did anybody eat those?

00:02:52.538 --> 00:02:54.640
